      "name": "NoAutoRebootWithLoggedOnUsers",
      "kind": "DWord",
      "value": 1
    }
  ],
  "revert": "restoreFromBackup",
  "sources": [
    "Microsoft Learn: 'Manage device restarts after updates', section 'Delay automatic restart' and table 'Registry keys used to manage restart' (AUOptions = 4 and NoAutoRebootWithLoggedOnUsers = 1).",
    "Microsoft notes there that the policy does not work exactly as described and that restarts after quality updates can stop entirely if nobody signs out."
